TYPE=u64
GROUP=dolt
DOC=Seconds past which store-persist run removes an entry of the dolt-beads temp spool that the server holds no fd on. Held spills are kept until the filesystem is at SPIRA_DOLT_TMP_PRESSURE_PCT.
